Hello, @ALABSTM, the issue is not the length itself, but the undefined behavior for dereferencing uint32_t*  in CRYP_AESGCM_Process, which leads to an incorrect value of uint32_t during decryption (_somehow produces correct decrypted text but results in an invalid tag_).

