polling_step will never be 1 if Size is < 4 so the entire if (polling_step == 1U) {} block is skipped and since hhash->Phase is not HAL_HASH_PHASE_READY there is basically no code left in the function. Something here is seriously wrong.

I assume this is a supported use case based on the comments from HAL_HASHEx_SHA256_Accmlt_IT and HAL_HASHEx_SHA256_Accmlt_End_IT since they are just aliases for HASH_Accumulate_IT and HASH_Start_IT respectively.

