Hello @mariuszste,

Thank you for your contribution. It appears that the issue is indeed related to the buffer size parameter used in your HASH_Start_IT function call. 
The function HASH_Start_IT(&hhash, buf, 2, out, HASH_ALGOSELECTION_SHA256); is currently configured to process only the first 2 bytes of the buffer buf, as indicated by the size parameter. This means that it does not consider the remaining bytes. 

